WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:02.140
(applause)
- Ellen is joining us today!

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.260
- Hi, Ellen!
- Yeah, see.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.908
- Yeah, she brought me a gift
(chuckles)

00:00:04.908 --> 00:00:08.205
- I love Ellen, I did not bring
any televisions though, I--

00:00:08.205 --> 00:00:09.578
(laughing)

00:00:09.578 --> 00:00:11.130
I apologize.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.418
- But you're an EGOT winner.

00:00:13.418 --> 00:00:14.251
- [John] Yeah.

00:00:14.251 --> 00:00:15.084
- So you don't need to bring anything,

00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:15.938
you just show up and bless us.

00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:17.358
(audience cheering)

00:00:17.358 --> 00:00:18.191
- Uh, you've been, you know,

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.480
sometimes we trade favors in the business

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.660
and Kelly has been on my show.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.493
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:00:25.493 --> 00:00:26.326
- Trailer Talk.
- Trailer Talk.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.198
(John laughing)

00:00:27.198 --> 00:00:28.317
- Trailer Talk.

00:00:28.317 --> 00:00:30.589
Actually, it's amazing.

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:31.890
- Trailer Talk is--

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:32.950
- I missed the Terry Crews one.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.669
- Has a way smaller budget
than Kelly Clarkson's show.

00:00:35.669 --> 00:00:36.502
(audience laughing)

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.069
We don't have any mics.
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:41.138
- We don't have proper
seating for our guests,

00:00:41.138 --> 00:00:43.910
we only air it on IGTV, and uh--

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.418
- [Kelly] And you keep it real.

00:00:45.418 --> 00:00:46.251
You keep it real.

00:00:46.251 --> 00:00:47.750
- But we do sing songs together, it's fun.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:48.740
- You do and you have all these people,

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.140
and I missed Terry Crews the other day

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:51.270
in the compound at The Voice.
- Yes.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.370
- I was so sad, I love him.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.570
- We sang Anniversary
by Tony! Toni! Toné!,

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:55.403
you know that song?

00:00:55.403 --> 00:00:56.580
- Oh my gosh.
- [Audience] Aw.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:57.716
- I love him, he's fun.

00:00:57.716 --> 00:00:59.815
- He's fantastic, I love
him, such a good guy.

00:00:59.815 --> 00:01:00.765
- Okay, but wait, I do
have a question though.

00:01:00.765 --> 00:01:01.598
- Mm-hm?

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:02.920
- Because I feel like y'all travel,

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.185
every time I see you at The Voice.

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:05.018
- Yes.

00:01:05.018 --> 00:01:05.851
- You're like, we just
got back from Japan,

00:01:05.851 --> 00:01:07.380
we just got back from
Russia, we just got back,

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.800
but I'm like, geez, like how
are Chrissy and the kids?

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.633
How y'all doin'?

00:01:10.633 --> 00:01:11.466
- Jet lagged?

00:01:11.466 --> 00:01:12.299
- They're good, everybody's jet lagged.

00:01:12.299 --> 00:01:13.132
Yes.
- Yeah.

00:01:13.132 --> 00:01:13.965
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.965 --> 00:01:14.798
- We just got back from Thailand.

00:01:14.798 --> 00:01:15.631
(audience laughing)

00:01:15.631 --> 00:01:16.900
- Oh my gosh, like, I'm telling you,

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.613
it's a different county,
it's not even like,

00:01:18.613 --> 00:01:20.443
you know somebody's like,
oh I went to Nebraska.

00:01:20.443 --> 00:01:21.350
(John chuckling)

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.120
It's like a whole flight,
like a whole thing.

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.703
- Well, I have gigs a lot of times.

00:01:25.703 --> 00:01:26.536
- [Audience] Aw.

00:01:26.536 --> 00:01:28.000
- [John] Yep, that's Thailand

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.890
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.376
- So, Chrissy's mother is from Thailand.

00:01:31.376 --> 00:01:32.209
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:01:32.209 --> 00:01:33.930
- If you guys wanna
follow her on Instagram.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.184
She's an instagranny too.

00:01:35.184 --> 00:01:37.154
(audience cheering)

00:01:37.154 --> 00:01:38.534
- She's hilarious!

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:41.170
- She's pepperthai2 on Instagram,

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:43.540
but she's originally from Thailand

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.873
and we went to visit
Thailand for the first time

00:01:45.873 --> 00:01:47.920
with the kids, they'd never been there

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.550
to see their grandmother's homeland.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:51.940
And so it was cool, we got
to see some of the relatives

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.013
and we had a really good time.

00:01:53.013 --> 00:01:53.850
- That's really cool.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:54.683
I love it.

00:01:54.683 --> 00:01:56.220
- It's beautiful, the food's amazing.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.680
I ate some crazy things though.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.226
- Oh, see I don't do that.

00:01:59.226 --> 00:02:01.390
- I'll try anything and--

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.340
- I'll try anything, but like a tiny--

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.470
- I had a cricket.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:04.942
- No, okay, I won't.

00:02:04.942 --> 00:02:06.530
(audience chuckling)

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:08.400
Was it covered in chocolate?

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.233
- No.

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:10.066
- I'd eat it then.

00:02:10.066 --> 00:02:10.899
(laughing)

00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:12.522
- It coulda used some seasoning, actually.

00:02:12.522 --> 00:02:14.420
(audience laughing)

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.431
It was all right.

00:02:15.431 --> 00:02:18.451
It wasn't bad, my stomach's still fine.

00:02:18.451 --> 00:02:20.280
(laughing)

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.670
- Wait, so Chrissy, the
thing I love about her

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.441
is she always calls you out on line?

00:02:23.441 --> 00:02:24.274
- Yes.

00:02:24.274 --> 00:02:25.107
- Like, she calls him out.

00:02:25.107 --> 00:02:25.940
- All the time.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:27.270
- Like, makes fun of him hardcore.

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:28.103
- All the time.

00:02:28.103 --> 00:02:28.936
- It's so funny.

00:02:28.936 --> 00:02:30.920
So what did she recently
do with the Insta-husband?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.790
- Well, she made a post about

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:37.860
how no one ever takes
pictures of her on vacation,

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:41.040
and she was like woe is me.
(audience chuckling)

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:44.430
No one gets good angles of me.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.899
And I felt like I was
being directly attacked.

00:02:46.899 --> 00:02:48.120
(laughing)

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:51.040
I feel like I take really
good pictures of her

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:52.450
and she posts some of them,

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.588
and so I made a point of pointing out--

00:02:54.588 --> 00:02:55.421
- [Audience] Aw.

00:02:55.421 --> 00:02:57.720
- First of all, does she
ever take a bad picture?

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.738
'Cause she's super hot.

00:02:58.738 --> 00:03:00.050
- Well, I don't think she does, but I--

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:00.883
- [Kelly] Good answer.

00:03:00.883 --> 00:03:03.860
- [John] I make an effort
to give her good lighting

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.050
and give her good angles.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:05.883
- [Kelly] That's a good man.

00:03:05.883 --> 00:03:07.122
- [John] And so I--

00:03:07.122 --> 00:03:07.955
(audience wooing)

00:03:07.955 --> 00:03:08.788
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:09.708
(audience clapping)

00:03:09.708 --> 00:03:12.440
- I posted these afterwards
and my hashtag was,

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:16.000
good Instagram husband, because
I wanted to prove because,

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.950
and Dwade, who's a friend of ours too,

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:20.430
a great basketball
player, he said basically,

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.735
when women get married now,

00:03:21.735 --> 00:03:26.060
I think part of what they're
getting with getting a husband

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.420
is getting someone who'll
take Instagram photos of them

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.625
for life.
(audience laughing)

00:03:29.625 --> 00:03:30.890
- My husband is so lucky.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.825
- I agree.

00:03:31.825 --> 00:03:34.594
- No, my husband is so
lucky, we never do anything,

00:03:34.594 --> 00:03:36.710
they have to force me, 'cause I feel like,

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.230
I feel like I don't have anything prolific

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.900
or anything relevant to say,

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.350
like it's really hard sometimes.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.663
- So, that's why you have a talk show?

00:03:43.663 --> 00:03:47.013
(laughing)
(audience clapping)

00:03:47.013 --> 00:03:47.846
- No!

00:03:47.846 --> 00:03:50.723
Because this is the time
I actually get to listen.

00:03:50.723 --> 00:03:53.277
You know me, I never listen,
I'm a talker, like so--

00:03:53.277 --> 00:03:55.330
- You're doin' good,
you're asking questions,

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.163
you're listening to the answer.

00:03:56.163 --> 00:03:56.996
- I am, I am.

00:03:56.996 --> 00:03:58.810
Well, and I actually
want to hear this answer,

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.280
'cause I don't actually
know this full answer,

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.230
but, how did you and Chrissy meet?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.240
'Cause I know we were on Duets together

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.520
and y'all were dating,
but how did y'all meet?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:07.025
- We met in 2006, and it's
actually our anniversary week.

00:04:07.025 --> 00:04:08.425
- [Kelly] Wow.
(audience cheering)

00:04:08.425 --> 00:04:09.692
(audience clapping)

00:04:09.692 --> 00:04:10.525
- What?

00:04:10.525 --> 00:04:14.330
- So we met on the day my second album,

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.880
Once Again, was released,
September 13 of 2006,

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.240
and I shot a music
video that day with her.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.772
- Oh, she was in it.

00:04:21.772 --> 00:04:23.720
- She was the lead woman
in the music video.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:26.850
And the guy who shot the video
is a good friend of ours,

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.470
and he knew both of us, and he
thought we might hit it off.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.890
And he was like, showed
me a picture of her,

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:34.280
and was like, do you mind
if I cast her in the video?

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.421
And he was like, I think you'll like her.

00:04:36.421 --> 00:04:37.396
(audience chuckling)

00:04:37.396 --> 00:04:38.287
- I think he did.

00:04:38.287 --> 00:04:40.080
- And I think I liked her,

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:44.710
and so we've been dating
since September of 2006,

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.980
and we got married in September of 2013,

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:50.580
so it's our dual anniversary this week.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.413
- [Kelly] That's so cool.

00:04:51.413 --> 00:04:52.845
- [John] And we're going to Paris!

00:04:52.845 --> 00:04:53.895
- Oh yes!
(audience clapping)

00:04:53.895 --> 00:04:54.728
All right.

00:04:54.728 --> 00:04:58.210
Well, as you may know,
John and I are both coaches

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.199
on The Voice, which I've
won more, but it's fine,

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:01.040
no one's counting.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.152
- She's never beaten me,
she's never beaten me.

00:05:03.152 --> 00:05:07.303
- I have not beat him, but
it premieres September 23rd.

00:05:07.303 --> 00:05:09.023
(audience cheering)

00:05:09.023 --> 00:05:11.920
We also have lovebirds, Blake
Shelton and Gwen Stefani,

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.850
they're our other two judges this season.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.990
What's been your favorite
part of the show this season?

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:18.132
- I love how deep the talent is this year.

00:05:18.132 --> 00:05:18.965
- [Kelly] That was mine.

00:05:18.965 --> 00:05:23.790
- I really feel like last season,
which was my first season,

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:27.530
I think there were clear
favorites that were really, like,

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.120
head and shoulders above the rest.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:33.070
But this year, I feel like
the depth from the top half

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.132
of my team to the bottom half is like,

00:05:34.132 --> 00:05:36.080
it's like, this narrow.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.370
Everybody's really good and
really close to each other.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.240
- It's no joke, it's the
best season I've been on,

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:44.474
like as a whole, all the
talent, it's insane this season.

00:05:44.474 --> 00:05:45.941
- So good.

00:05:45.941 --> 00:05:46.830
And we're havin' so much fun.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:47.663
- We are!

00:05:47.663 --> 00:05:48.528
- Gwen is really great.

00:05:48.528 --> 00:05:49.361
- I know.

00:05:49.361 --> 00:05:50.194
- Great chemistry with her.

00:05:50.194 --> 00:05:51.050
- [Kelly] I had never
worked with her before.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:51.883
- [John] Me neither.

00:05:51.883 --> 00:05:52.716
- [Kelly] Yeah, it's really good.

00:05:52.716 --> 00:05:53.685
- I never really spent
much time around her.

00:05:53.685 --> 00:05:54.920
- I like how she reels the cowboy in.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.840
- Yes.
(audience laughing)

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.450
- It's the best season
just to watch her be like,

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:02.205
Blakey I want this one, and
then he like gives it to her.

00:06:02.205 --> 00:06:03.145
(laughing)

00:06:03.145 --> 00:06:03.978
- It's awesome.

00:06:03.978 --> 00:06:04.811
- He's a sucker, he's a sucker.

00:06:04.811 --> 00:06:06.807
- He's a sucker for her, yes!

